# Anchored with a leading slash, all of them.
#
# An unanchored name matches every path component of that name, not just the
# one at the top: in the sibling repository an unanchored "ypstns" swallowed
# etc/rc.d/ypstns and the whole of pkg/openbsd/net/ypstns, and nothing noticed
# until a packing list check ran in CI.  Nothing here collides today, and the
# anchor is what keeps that true.
*.o
*.core
*.dSYM/
/ldapstns
/stns-key-wrapper
/pam_stns.so
/ber_test
/ber_test-asan
/stns_test
/stns_crypt_test
/stns_crypt_test-asan
__pycache__/
*.pyc
